WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:07.100
The main exporter of Brazil nuts is not Brazil.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.480
It's Bolivia.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:17.300
Vikings who died in bed rather than battle
went to a special afterlife where it was always

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.720
foggy.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.610
The difference between the hardwood and softwood
has to do with its seeds, and has nothing

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:27.270
to do with how hard or soft the wood is.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:32.550
Almost a third of the worlds languages are
spoken only in Africa.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:38.820
Air pollution kills 4000 Chinese people per
day.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:42.990
Giraffe are already extinct in at least seven
countries in Africa.

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:50.999
A recent study found that sitting straight
up at 90 degrees is bad for your back.

00:00:50.999 --> 00:00:58.379
You should slouch at an angle of 135 degrees
to provide maximum support for your spine.

00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:03.370
Cremation causes silicone breast implants
to explode.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:09.820
According to Switzerland's law, social animals
like guinea pigs must live with a buddy.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:14.910
Owning only one is considered animal abuse
and is illegal.

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:20.120
Canada has the longest coastline of any country
in the world.

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:25.430
The original recipe for chocolate contained
chili powder instead of sugar.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.450
Shark pregnancies last for up to 4 years.

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:34.460
Even though the west is accustomed to apples,
oranges and bananas the most commonly eaten

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.490
fruit around the world is actually mangos.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:43.380
Hospital, a village in Ireland, doesn't have
a hospital.

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:53.670
The CIA operation to invade Cuba and take
down Castro was called “Operation Castration”.

